        <field_value_description><para>Disables the use of Virtual tagging at EL2, EL1 and EL0.</para>
<para>If <xref linkend="#FEAT_MTE2">FEAT_MTE2</xref> is not implemented or <register_link state="AArch64" id="AArch64-scr_el3.xml">SCR_EL3</register_link>.ATA is 0, the specified registers are trapped to EL3 unless trapped to a lower Exception level.</para>
<para>If <xref linkend="#FEAT_MTE2">FEAT_MTE2</xref> is implemented and <register_link state="AArch64" id="AArch64-scr_el3.xml">SCR_EL3</register_link>.ATA is 1, this field does not trap the specified registers to EL3.</para></field_value_description>
      </field_value_instance>
